### Create doctor
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/doctors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "firstName": "Anaya",
  "lastName": "Rao",
  "email": "anaya.rao@hospital.com",
  "specialization": "Neurology",
  "phoneNumber": "+91-9876500100"
}

### Create appointment
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/appointments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "doctorId": "423e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "appointmentTime": "2030-01-10T11:00:00",
  "durationMinutes": 30,
  "status": "SCHEDULED",
  "notes": "Follow-up"
}

### Create billing record
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/billing-records
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-2001",
  "amount": 1500.00,
  "status": "PENDING",
  "dueDate": "2030-01-20",
  "description": "Consultation fee"
}
